SUMMARY:Mindful Meet & Mingle at Quietude 
DESCRIPTION:Mindful Meet & Mingle – Asheville Singles\n**Mindful Meet & 
 Mingle at Quitetude**\nThis is a connection event (not a dating specific e
 vent) for all singles. We'll open with some grounding and centering time a
 t the beautiful Lodge at Quietude. Then we'll split up into pairs with sug
 gested questions with the intention to develop meaningful connections. You
 'll have the opportunity to pair up four or five times with a brief center
 ing before each new encounter. Then we'll have an open time to socialize.\
 n\n**IMPORTANT: Please park behind The Wellness Center at [1141 Montreat R
 d\, Black Mountain](https://www.google.com/maps/search/1141+Montreat+Rd\,+
 Black+Mountain?entry=gmail&source=g) and walk down to Quietude at [1130 Mo
 ntreat Rd](https://www.google.com/maps/search/1130+Montreat+Rd?entry=gmail
 &source=g).**\n\n**Donations will be gratefully accepted and given to Quie
 tude for use of the space.**\n\n**Note: Space is limited to 30\, so please
  only sign up if you can make it and cancel if something comes up to allow
  others an opportunity to join in.**
